   answer:'IV: pen in teeth (smile-like), lips (smile blocked) or control. DV: cartoon funniness ratings. Teeth > lips. Botox studies are a second line of evidence: weakening frown muscles slowed processing of angry and sad material. Large replications have questioned the pen effect.'
