   q('Which emotion is NOT one of the six universal emotions listed on the lecture slide?',['Surprise','Disgust','Contempt','Fear'],2,'The lecture’s six are happiness, sadness, fear, disgust, anger and surprise. The textbook discusses contempt in a broader account, but it is not on the lecture’s list.',['Surprise is on the list.','Disgust is on the list.','Correct: contempt is discussed in the text but is not one of the lecture’s six.','Fear is on the list.'],'Learn the lecture’s set of six exactly; textbook extensions like contempt are a common distractor.')
